                                                "example_id": "2f87a93d-f605-472f-b770-1cccc14a238d",
                                                "sense_id": "761f1c91-8df9-346f-b0ac-1a4ebe09b0d4",
                                                "text": "Holonyms: monosaccharide, oligosaccharide, polysaccharide"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b49a14f-f701-44ef-92ce-db04a3d08c42",
                                                "sense_id": "761f1c91-8df9-346f-b0ac-1a4ebe09b0d4",
                                                "text": "The saccharides include such substances as dextrose and levulose, which are typical examples of the two classes into which these bodies are divisible, viz. the Aldoses and Ketoses."
